# Environment files
# Exclude all runtime env files so secrets never reach the repo.
# Committed documentation files that describe PUBLIC (non-secret) settings
# are intentionally NOT excluded here — e.g. .env.production documents the
# public NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL placeholder.
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
.env.*.local
.env.local.*
!.env.production

